    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 104,
        "text": "Hi Lucy, do you have a minute? I want to look at last month's sales figures for our two coffee shops.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "730c65926fff05264228c552475912edf1bb512d0834a307b738a25725465b3c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "f",
        "speaker": "F",
        "sourceStart": 108,
        "sourceEnd": 163,
        "text": "Sure, Tom. I have the numbers here. Let's compare them.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f2aea8af1a291c095b20e5eeb0e00c9e5668de7c1df396142a7f1b8b5ec4b964",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 167,
        "sourceEnd": 227,
        "text": "Great. So, the city centre shop made £12,000 in June, right?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "748b9d2424fdb3dd1f1f7f8b9c4388bf8837549bbd44387c73d7f7cdd631b89b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "f",
        "speaker": "F",
        "sourceStart": 231,
        "sourceEnd": 322,
        "text": "Yes, that's correct. And the station shop made £9,000. So the city centre shop earned more.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "b0c13f81737d2a656a6d154e676512f4190b6b9d1436ad43713b3af7145741c4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 326,
        "sourceEnd": 406,
        "text": "Right, £3,000 more. That's a big difference. What about the number of customers?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b848abd40c26d1d6d08506b62357b3f760a5929f081b77641d248eaf90d5abc3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "f",
        "speaker": "F",
        "sourceStart": 410,
        "sourceEnd": 533,
        "text": "The city centre shop had 4,000 customers, and the station shop had 3,000. So the city centre shop had 1,000 more customers.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "de7c7f41ca3c14092e4bed8f3ee6fbed1e85701130c139932aa771f6f892ef64",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 537,
        "sourceEnd": 586,
        "text": "OK. And how about the average spend per customer?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ca0ce395190884e3674ec69017dd98c6f55636aad1178702f29928856d104f58",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "f",
        "speaker": "F",
        "sourceStart": 590,
        "sourceEnd": 685,
        "text": "At the city centre shop, it was £3. At the station shop, it was also £3. So they were the same.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1dbb60439a026564b4dfd3c1ebda28b4ba93b38125266323d331b09ca2a922f4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 689,
        "sourceEnd": 755,
        "text": "Interesting. Now, what about the trend over the last three months?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "84e29b35d8d93d149303d2f3afd0ff73069b1c3097c2a07f8eb87a76b5698123",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "f",
        "speaker": "F",
        "sourceStart": 759,
        "sourceEnd": 875,
        "text": "Well, sales at the city centre shop increased from £10,000 in April to £12,000 in June. That's a rise of 20 percent.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "51bda173c0f2e640c5a2228c1974e42ff41f7fd7cb5d58dbb287900701529aba",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 879,
        "sourceEnd": 900,
        "text": "And the station shop?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "da9fe757ed8530c9da119ba2a9a36e8145af7b94070f33add642aa6c8adb1da0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "f",
        "speaker": "F",
        "sourceStart": 904,
        "sourceEnd": 995,
        "text": "The station shop's sales went up from £8,000 to £9,000. That's an increase of 12.5 percent.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c390b2396b2ca5af0cb4e9edf0b045f67632d60d92792eae381a793d8c319813",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 999,
        "sourceEnd": 1055,
        "text": "So the city centre shop grew faster in percentage terms.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "28e322e4919ab199828b27bf63da5fae4882897d0605e90eb1afdc0f22d43a2b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "f",
        "speaker": "F",
        "sourceStart": 1059,
        "sourceEnd": 1282,
        "text": "Yes, but the station shop had a higher percentage increase in customer numbers. It went from 2,500 to 3,000, which is a 20 percent rise. The city centre shop's customers only went up by 5 percent, from about 3,800 to 4,000.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "04b87d9cec16954ae4d5de6daab02f64680d2c93f1d6c2e0214bd128b85be60b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1286,
        "sourceEnd": 1361,
        "text": "Oh, I didn't know that. So the station shop is growing faster in customers.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "5bf081616fd7ea5259e9ccbba6691ef1c02bbf982bf05ffb488de245219a9727",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "f",
        "speaker": "F",
        "sourceStart": 1365,
        "sourceEnd": 1473,
        "text": "Exactly. Also, there was a special promotion at the station shop in May, so that might explain the increase.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "410828c4ddb594c7bf2713b5a0421e5484abbd156dc745597bcd4a2305d82a45",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1477,
        "sourceEnd": 1535,
        "text": "Good point. Was there a promotion at the city centre shop?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "cb51383bf7aa3c605fcc733054ccc34aa8c7c057751782a177aba3238f37db61",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "f",
        "speaker": "F",
        "sourceStart": 1539,
        "sourceEnd": 1615,
        "text": "No, there wasn't. But there were more staff at the city centre shop in June.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a98963d748426a6329315e1f6a1e16c3d02a84b65fcc1dbc72fdbff206e9963f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1619,
        "sourceEnd": 1634,
        "text": "How many staff?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "15a73e29e304e7113c5e6056b01131bc8fe44e3cba75adf31a5c591fc60f8909",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "f",
        "speaker": "F",
        "sourceStart": 1638,
        "sourceEnd": 1708,
        "text": "There were 10 staff at the city centre shop and 6 at the station shop.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "6079db983b9f6e1306938eaea5b53c134041e2e43ce3402f26901010371f07d1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1712,
        "sourceEnd": 1860,
        "text": "OK. So, to summarise: the city centre shop has higher sales and more customers, but the station shop is growing faster in terms of customer numbers.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a170ca4b1ccf00b48889db7298ffaea3f46c1595c7802c45471691042541d3db",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "f",
        "speaker": "F",
        "sourceStart": 1864,
        "sourceEnd": 1933,
        "text": "That's right. And both shops had the same average spend per customer.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3c124d4c874aca7743a9668597bbbde3ade386c9ec038cc0979ac706fca72770",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1937,
        "sourceEnd": 1973,
        "text": "Thanks, Lucy. This is really useful.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "8bcf5d08097a80eec4d86f53435703af519385511b8407cdb0681c18fa0bf80d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
